
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<title>404</title>
</head>
<style>
	*{
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
	}
	body{
		font-family: "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, "Microsoft Yahei", "Hiragino Sans GB", "Heiti SC";
		background: #f5f5f5;
	}
	.content{
		width: 470px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		margin-top:150px;
	}
	p{
		text-align: center;
		color: #8d8d8d;
		font-size: 18px;
		margin: 42px 0;
	}
	.btn{
		overflow: hidden;
		width: 440px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}
	.btn a{
		display: inline-block;
		width: 140px;
		height: 42px;
		line-height: 42px;
		text-align: center;
		text-decoration: none;
		background: #626b86;
		border-radius: 6px;
		color: #fff;
		font-size: 16px;
	}
	.btn a:hover{
		background: #474e61
	}
	.return-back{
		float: left;
	}
	.return-home{
		float: right;
	}

</style>
<body>
<div class="content">
	<img src="/themes/images/404.jpg">
	<p>很抱歉，您访问的页面不存在...</p>
	<div class="btn">
		<a href="javascript:window.history.go(-1)" class="return-back">返回上级</a>
		<a href="/" class="return-home">返回首页</a>
	</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>